#. 【夢】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[dream]"
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、舞園さんの夢は？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well...what about you, Sayaka?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんの夢も聞かせてよ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's your dream? I'd love to hear..."
msgstr ""

#. 私は……私の夢は……
msgctxt "0004 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I... My dream is..."
msgstr ""

#. 幼い頃から、ずっとアイドルに憧れていました。
msgctxt "0005 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I've always wanted to be a star, as long as I can\n"
"remember."
msgstr ""

#. …ウチってね、父子家庭だったんです。
msgctxt "0006 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I grew up without a mother, you know..."
msgstr ""

#. お父さんは毎日、夜遅くまで働いてて…
#. 私は、いっつも１人でお留守番。
msgctxt "0007 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"And my dad worked really late every night. I was\n"
"always home alone..."
msgstr ""

#. まだ子供だったし…ちょっと寂しかった…
msgctxt "0008 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I was just a kid, ya know? So I was really lonely."
msgstr ""

#. でも、そんな私の寂しさを紛らわしてくれたのが、
#. テレビの中で活躍しているアイドルの姿だったんです。
msgctxt "0009 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But that all changed when I saw a pop star on TV for\n"
"the first time."
msgstr ""

#. お姫様みたいに可愛くて、歌もうまくて、
#. 踊りも上手…
msgctxt "0010 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"She was so pretty, like a princess. And she could\n"
"sing, and dance..."
msgstr ""

#. 何より…あの笑顔…
msgctxt "0011 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But more than anything else, there was her smile."
msgstr ""

#. あの笑顔を見ていると、
#. 私の寂しさなんて、いつの間にか吹っ飛んでいました。
msgctxt "0012 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Looking at her smile, I could feel my loneliness\n"
"melting away."
msgstr ""

#. だから…いつか私も、そんな風に
#. みんなを勇気づけられるアイドルになりたいって…
msgctxt "0013 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I decided that's what I wanted to be someday. I wanted\n"
"to give that kind of encouragement to others."
msgstr ""

#. …そう思うようになったんです。
msgctxt "0014 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Eventually, that became my dream."
msgstr ""

#. でも、すごいよね。
#. 子供の頃からの夢を本当に叶えちゃうなんてさ！
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's so amazing, though. You were able to actually\n"
"fulfill your lifelong dream."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…すごいよ……
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Honestly, it's really incredible."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0017 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 私は夢を叶える為に、今までなんでもしてきました…
msgctxt "0018 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I did whatever it took to reach that dream."
msgstr ""

#. 嫌な事も含めて…本当になんでも…
msgctxt "0019 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I mean it. Even some things that...weren't so\n"
"pleasant."
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 夢は追い続ければ、いつかきっと叶う…
#. 私もそう思いますけど…
msgctxt "0021 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I honestly believed that as long as you kept chasing\n"
"your dreams, someday they had to come true."
msgstr ""

#. でも、その為には
#. ずっと夢を見続けなくちゃいけないんです…
msgctxt "0022 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But to do that, you can't take your eyes off of your\n"
"dream, not even for a second."
msgstr ""

#. それが悪夢であろうと…
#. 起きていようと、寝ていようと…
msgctxt "0023 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Even if sometimes it's a bad dream... Whether you're\n"
"awake, whether you're asleep..."
msgstr ""

#. 夢をかなえる為には、
#. ずっと、夢を見続けてなくちゃいけないんです。
msgctxt "0024 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"To make your dream a reality, you have to keep your\n"
"gaze fixed on it no matter what."
msgstr ""

#. あの世界では、少しでも気を緩めれば、
#. すぐに置いていかれちゃう…
msgctxt "0025 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"In that world, if you lose focus for even a split\n"
"second, you get left behind."
msgstr ""

#. 息継ぎなしで、
#. 水中を全力で泳ぎ続けなくちゃいけない…
msgctxt "0026 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"You have to keep on swimming against the current,\n"
"without even taking time to breathe..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に、そんな感じの世界なんです。
msgctxt "0027 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "That's the kind of world my dream lives in."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなに大変なんだ…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-Is it really that tough?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…楽しくないの…？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it not fun at all?"
msgstr ""

#. …ううん、そんな事ありません。
#. 楽しいですよ、すっごく！
msgctxt "0030 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Oh no, don't get the wrong idea. It's super fun!"
msgstr ""

#. でも…だから怖いんです…
msgctxt "0031 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But...that's exactly what scares me."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今は…本当に毎日すっごく楽しいんです。
msgctxt "0033 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I enjoy every single day I wake up and get to do what\n"
"I do."
msgstr ""

#. 同じグループのみんなも本当に素敵な仲間達で…
#. みんないい友達だし、いいライバルで…
msgctxt "0034 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Everyone in our group is amazing. We're rivals in a\n"
"way, but they all mean so much to me."
msgstr ""

#. 昔からずっと一緒にやってきた
#. <CLT 3>大切な仲間達<CLT>なんです。
msgctxt "0035 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"We've been performing together since we were young, so\n"
"they're all <CLT 3>like family to me<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. みんながいなかったら…
#. 私はとっくに夢をあきらめてたかもしれません…
msgctxt "0036 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Without them, I would have given up on my dream a long\n"
"time ago."
msgstr ""

#. みんなと一緒に夢を叶えて、一緒に仕事出来て、
#. 今はすっごく幸せです。
msgctxt "0037 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"To work together, and fulfill our dreams together, has\n"
"brought me so much happiness..."
msgstr ""

#. でも…だから…
#. 時々怖くなるんです。
msgctxt "0038 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But that's the thing that scares me the most."
msgstr ""

#. いつか世間に飽きられて…
#. そうしたら…私達どうなっちゃうのかなって…
msgctxt "0039 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"If the world gets tired of us, then what happens? What\n"
"happens to us?"
msgstr ""

#. 夢を失って、楽しい日々も終わって…
#. みんな…バラバラになっちゃうのかなって……
msgctxt "0040 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Then the dream dies, those wonderful days come to an\n"
"end, and everyone goes their separate ways..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ま、舞園さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>S-Sayaka...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>震えてる…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's trembling...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうか…舞園さんは恐れているんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She must be terrified.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>苦労して手に入れた最高の夢だからこそ、
#. 舞園さんは、それを失う事を恐れているんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She worked so hard, sacrificed so much, to get where\n"
"she is. She must be terrified of losing it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私が希望ヶ峰学園に入学を決めたのも、
#. そんな理由からなんです。
msgctxt "0045 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "So that's the reason I decided to come to Hope's Peak."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　どういう意味？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…ここを卒業出来れば…
#. 間違いなく成功を手に出来るんですよね？
msgctxt "0047 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Well...they say that if you graduate from here,\n"
"success is basically guaranteed."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたら…私は大切なグループの仲間と、
#. ずっと一緒に活躍し続けられるじゃないですか…
msgctxt "0048 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Which means I could keep on performing with my best\n"
"friends, for ever and ever."
msgstr ""

#. そう思ってた…んですけど……
msgctxt "0049 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "At least, that's what I thought."
msgstr ""

#. そう…思ってたのに……それなのに…
msgctxt "0050 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I really did believe that, but..."
msgstr ""

#. こ、こんな場所に閉じ込められて……
#. 出られないなんて……
msgctxt "0051 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "...now we're trapped here, with no way out."
msgstr ""

#. きっと…仲間も待ってるのに……
msgctxt "0052 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "They're probably waiting for me..."
msgstr ""

#. こうしている間にも…忘れられていく……
msgctxt "0053 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"While I'm in here, the world out there is forgetting\n"
"about me."
msgstr ""

#. どんどん…私達が…消えていく……
msgctxt "0054 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Minute by minute, we're all disappearing."
msgstr ""

#. それ…なのに……
msgctxt "0055 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But still..."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園…さん……？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私にはっ！
#. こんな事をしている余裕はないのにッ！！
msgctxt "0057 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I can't afford to be stuck in here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは、ボクが初めて聞いた、
#. 彼女の心からの叫びだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That was the first time I heard her cry out from deep\n"
"within herself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の怒りだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She sounds...desperate.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…その怒りも、もっともなのかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I can understand why she'd feel that way.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、彼女はここに閉じ込められたせいで、
#. 努力して掴んだ“仲間との夢”を失いかけているんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Trapped here this way, the dream she put so much\n"
"effort into is on the verge of disappearing forever.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、努力なんて言葉だけでは片付けられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that isn't something that can be fixed with a few\n"
"kind words.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その重さは…
#. ボクなんかには計り知れないんだから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The weight she's carrying... I can't even imagine it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ…ごめんなさい…
#. 愚痴なんか言っちゃって……
msgctxt "0064 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ah—I'm sorry, I didn't mean to complain..."
msgstr ""

#. 気を…悪くしましたよね？
msgctxt "0065 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I kinda killed the mood, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. う、ううん…そんな事ないよ。
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr ""

#. ごめんなさい……
msgctxt "0067 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I'm really sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あ、あのさ…舞園さん…
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. …ところで、お腹すかない？
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Actually, are you hungry?"
msgstr ""

#. 部屋に戻る前に、
#. 食堂でご飯食べて行くなんて、どう？
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Before we head back, why don't we go to the dining\n"
"hall and get some food?"
msgstr ""

#. …………………
msgctxt "0072 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. だったら…
msgctxt "0073 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "So..."
msgstr ""

#. だったら作りましょうか？
#. 私、こう見えて上手なんですよ！
msgctxt "0074 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"You want me to make us something to eat? I might not\n"
"look like it, but I'm actually a pretty good cook!"
msgstr ""

#. え、ホントに？　何が得意なの？
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wow, really? What's your specialty?"
msgstr ""

#. ラー油です。
msgctxt "0076 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Chili oil."
msgstr ""

#. …調味料！？
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You mean the condiment!?"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、冗談ですよ。
msgctxt "0078 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Hahaha. Just kidding!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、舞園さんは笑った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She burst out laughing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっきの感情的な表情は消えていて、
#. そこには、いつもの明るい表情だけがあった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her earlier mood disappeared, replaced by the bright\n"
"smile I'd quickly grown used to.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…どうしてだろう？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But how'd it happen so fast?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが、まるで仮面のような、
#. よそ行きの表情にも思えたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was almost like a mask, like some kind of neutral\n"
"expression.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、舞園さんと共に、
#. 食堂で食事をし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, we headed to the dining hall to get something\n"
"to eat...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、それぞれの個室へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...before returning to our rooms.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここですね。
#. 護身用の武器がありそうな所って。
msgctxt "0085 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Here we go. I might be able to find something here to\n"
"protect myself with..."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、あのショーウインドウに
#. 何か置いてありそうですね。
msgctxt "0086 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure I'll find something in the display case\n"
"I can use."
msgstr ""

#. えっと……
msgctxt "0087 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0088 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. お話しようって言っておきながら、
#. いざとなると、何を話していいかわかりませんね…
msgctxt "0089 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I know I said I wanted to talk to you, but now that\n"
"we're here...I don't really know what to talk about."
msgstr ""

#. ごめんなさい…私から誘っておいて…
msgctxt "0090 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"And I was the one who invited you to come with me,\n"
"too. Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. べ、別に…平気だよ…
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's okay."
msgstr ""

#. …っていうか、話す事がなければ、
#. 黙っててもいいんじゃないかな？
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I mean, if there's nothing to talk about, then we can\n"
"just not talk, right?"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0093 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 無理して話さなくても、
#. ２人でボーっとしてるだけで…いいんじゃないかな？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You don't have to force yourself to talk. We can just,\n"
"I dunno...stare off into space or whatever."
msgstr ""

#. ボーっとするだけ、ですか…？
msgctxt "0095 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Stare off into space...?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、でも…舞園さんは退屈だよね！
#. 何もしないでいるなんてさ…
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, but you're probably super bored! Just standing\n"
"around doing nothing..."
msgstr ""

#. いえ、退屈なんて事はありません。
#. ただ…
msgctxt "0097 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "No, it's not that it's boring. It's just..."
msgstr ""

#. 私、慣れてなくって。
#. その…ボーっとするって事に…
msgctxt "0098 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I've never really done it before. I don't have a lot\n"
"of time to just...do nothing."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだよね…
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I guess that makes sense."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんは、ボクみたいな普通の高校生と違って、
#. 毎日忙しい訳だし…
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're not a normal high school student like me.\n"
"You've got tons of stuff to do every day."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0101 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あの、唐突ですけど…
msgctxt "0102 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Hey, um...this is kinda out of nowhere, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君には<CLT 1>【夢】<CLT>とか…ありますか？
msgctxt "0103 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Makoto, do you have a <CLT 1>[dream]<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　夢…？
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? A dream...?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…まだ探してる途中…かな？
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Umm... I guess you could say I'm still shopping around\n"
"for one."
msgstr ""

#. …そうですか。
#. 見つかるといいですね、苗木君の夢。
msgctxt "0106 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Really? Well, I hope you find your dream someday."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Thanks..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしたんだ、舞園さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's wrong, Sayaka?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>急に…夢だなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Asking me about my dreams all of a sudden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ……
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなところも、
#. このカメラで見られているのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The cameras can see us even here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君…
#. 体育館に行く必要ってあるんですか？
msgctxt "0115 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Is there something you need to do in the gym?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あぁ…そうだよね。
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um...no, not really."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君。
#. もうちょっと、ここを調べてみませんか？
msgctxt "0117 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Why don't we look around here a little more?"
msgstr ""

#. まだ、何も見つかっていませんし…
msgctxt "0118 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "We still haven't found anything..."
msgstr ""

#. せっかくだから、
#. もう少しお話していきましょうよ…
msgctxt "0119 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"As long as we have this opportunity, why don't we talk\n"
"a bit more?"
msgstr ""
